WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.540
Before dawn in Amritsar, the Sikh scripture
is carried along a causeway to a temple

2
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:06.900
in a pool.

3
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.470
The temple has four
doors, one on each side.

4
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.260
And visitors step down to go in.

5
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.350
Every day, volunteers serve
a free meal to huge crowds,

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.920
all sitting on the floor in rows.

7
00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.650
Yet Sikhs believe God is everywhere.

8
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.280
So why do so many travel
to this one temple?

9
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.270
In this mission, you'll walk
through a pilgrim's day,

10
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.130
from dawn to night.

11
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.420
Then you'll hear what the
Gurus taught about holy places,

12
00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.500
and why Sikhs see pilgrimage differently.

13
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.840
Your mission: find out why so
many Sikhs travel to Amritsar,

14
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.310
if God is everywhere.
